; Handwritten boundary values from P11: abs(x),abs(y)<=1e-12 are axial; just outside is unsupported. Raw extrusion is retained.
; Raw DXF values independently checked against CI run 39925415850, job 120320505295.
D = DXF file=input.dxf
? count D -> CIRCLE 2
? unhandled D -> CIRCLE 1
? entity D 91 -> CIRCLE center=-2,3 radius=4 extrusion=1e-12,-1e-12,-1
? entity D 92 -> unhandled CIRCLE
? entity D 93 -> CIRCLE center=2,3 radius=4 extrusion=1e-12,-1e-12,1
? roundtrip D -> identical
